        "category": "Protect Stored Account Data",
        "title": "Additional requirement for issuers and companies that support issuing services and store sensitive authentication data: Any storage of sensitive authentication data is limited to that which is needed for a legitimate issuing business need and is secured. Encrypted using strong cryptography",
